{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_158_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，王正月，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"二、夏，葬鄭僖公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"三、鄭人侵蔡，獲蔡公子濕。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"人，微者也。侵，淺事也。而獲公子，公子病矣。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"四、季孫宿會晉侯、鄭伯、齊人、宋人、衞人、邾人於邢丘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"見魯之失正也，公在而大夫會也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"五、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"六、莒人伐我東鄙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"七、秋，九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"八、冬，楚公子貞帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_158_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_158","textTraditional":"九、晉侯使士匄來聘。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}